   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="1902_AS_RBH_1_00028" />Herrn <hi rend="latintype">Dr. Rich. Beer-Hofma<c rendition="#gemination-n" />
                  </hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb173" type="place">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Rodaun</hi>
                  </rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">
                     <rs ref="#pmb40101" type="place">Liesinger Hauptstr Nr 2</rs>
                  </hi>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <p>
               <pb facs="1902_AS_RBH_1_00030" />
               <salute>lieber Richard,</salute> Sie wollten mit <rs ref="#pmb10860" type="person">Paula</rs> in die <rs type="org" ref="#pmb29805">
                  <hi rend="latintype">Conserv</hi>.</rs> Vorſtellg gehen, ſagte mir neulich <rs type="person" ref="#pmb12740">Guſtav</rs>; Sie bekommen alſo Sitze geſchickt (für
                  <pb facs="1902_AS_RBH_1_00031" />
               <date>Dinſtag</date>. Also denſelben Tag, an dem ich Sie Vormittag <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01223-1" />zu ſehen hoffe<note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01223-1">
                  <ref target="1902-06-17" type="schnitzler-tagebuch" subtype="Cf" />.
               </note>
               <supplied>)</supplied>.</p>
            <closer>Herzlichen Gruſs.<lb />Ihr<lb />
               <signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
